message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "NiceMill: Positive Feedback Generation from Collaborative Interaction Videos Using Local Vision-Language Models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Hamada"
    given-names: "Reo"
    affiliation: "Shonan Institute of Technology"
  - family-names: "Shuzo"
    given-names: "Masaki"
    affiliation: "Shonan Institute of Technology"
abstract: >-
  NiceMill drafts personalized positive-feedback texts from collaborative-interaction videos with a
  local vision-language model; the evaluator checks the evidence scenes and approves each text.
  (Japanese title of the paper: ローカルVLMを用いた協働インタラクション動画からのポジティブ・フィードバック生成)
repository-code: "https://github.com/hamadareo/NiceMill"
keywords:
  - positive feedback
  - vision-language model
  - local inference
  - collaborative interaction
